The '''Buddy Sword''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Often used for its extreme range, Buddy Sword allows the player to deal high damage with speed, however, it also requires the user to have relatively good aim.

==Obtainment==
The Buddy Sword can be obtained after defeating the [[Cake Queen]], who can be found on the second island in the [[Sea of Treats]] ([[Sea of Treats#Ice Cream Land|Ice Cream Land]]), located in the [[Third Sea]].

